# Files this capability OWNS in a customer workspace. The workspace's init.ps1
# overwrites each one from Templates\customer-repo\ on every run, so they must be
# edited in this repo. Everything else in the template is a seed: copied once, then
# the workspace's own (programs/ in particular is authored by the engagement).
#
# One relative path per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.

governance/init.ps1

# The operator's preflight orchestration (ADR-009): a slash command, the
# workflow it invokes, the two subagent definitions it spawns, the skill that
# holds the observation rules, and the hook that keeps a shell-capable agent
# away from apply. Engine-owned so every workspace runs the same version.
.claude/commands/audit-preflight.md
.claude/workflows/audit-preflight.js
.claude/agents/governance-runner.md
.claude/agents/preflight-reporter.md
.claude/skills/preflight-report/SKILL.md
.claude/hooks/deny-governance-apply.ps1
